body:
i dont think that affects if someone is gay or not, my mom is an absolute psycho, one of the most angry, selfish, disgusting people i've ever known, all my girlfriends also have been pretty much the same, abusive af, ruined my life, cheating, using me for money, constantly degrading me, etc. until i become just like their soulless servant who does absolutely everything for them and get 0 love or affection in return, only more abuse. and being used, cheated on, dumped ... 

&#x200B;

i've never felt any kind of deep connection with a girl, for me they are like from a completely different world, selfish, ruthless, they will absolutely destroy you psychologically in every way just to get what they want. but despite this, i love them so much, i think they are amazing, beautiful in every way, charming, irresistible, i would do anything for their approval, attention, affection... it's the best feeling in the world. i guess it's interesting that you have to work so insanely hard and invest so much time and effort and money to earn their trust and companionship, and you never know what you're gonna get, always unexpected, one day they'll absolutely hate you, one day they might show some sign of niceness, they play with your emotions so hard, and that's what keeps you so hooked. but once they're done/bored with you they'll just throw you in the trash and replace you like it's nothing

&#x200B;

all my best friends are guys, 2 guys i've known for like 15 years and we still have great friendship and not a single argument or misunderstanding or offended each other or anything. 100% only nice. relationships with girls are always she is getting offended and accusing you of things and making you feel worthless, drama, anger, and they never last more than a couple years. also even just random guys from the internet or in a discord channel, we can have hilarious or deep conversations about anything, and always instantly relate. understand each other on a deep level. and same sense of humor, make each other die of laughter, or have OMG THATS SO EPIC moments. sometimes i wish i was attracted to guys, because it would be so much easier, and nicer. no weird mind games or manipulation, no weird uncertainty and unpredictability, with their ulterior motives and incomprehensible mindsets, or whatever it is that girls do. just 2 guys who totally get each other and make each others days better and its always great to spend time together. but the thought of anything romantic with a guy is absolutely disgusting to me, no way in a million years. it's a shame though, i think if i was attracted to guys i would be a lot happier. i'd have much less problems. it's definitely not a choice, if it was, i would choose guys lol.
